[[2047,15,65536,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is controlled by the\nignition (INT)from the line for fuse  \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               for the control\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : when the brake pedal is pressed, the switch closes\nand sends the operating signal to the check device inside the rev\ncounter \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 5 of connector A).</p><p>The supply for the check device inside \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               arrives\ndirectly from the battery (maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) at\npins 10 and 16 of connector A, through fuses \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F3</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ;  the former protects the circuits for\nthe lights on the left hand side, the latter those on the right.</p><p>The check device thereby controls the supply\n(pin 18 and pin 13 of connector A) for the side brake lights in\nthe rear light clusters \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>In the case of failures in the circuit,\nthe &quot;lights failure&quot; warning light - inside \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               -\ncomes on, with the supply controlled by the ignition (IINT), pin\n15 of connector A, of the line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the\nadditional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               .</p><p>The switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends the signal for\noperating the centre rear light cluster \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               via the junction\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 18, connector D and pin 14 of connector E).</p><p>The braking signal for the switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\nsent from the switch to the \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>ABS</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234769\">E7020</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) and - on some\nversions - to the engine management control unit as well (\n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234515\">E5030</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              or \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234559\">E5050</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p>"]]